  "solution_ref": "$2a^2(1+r^2)=5a^2r(1+r)$ → $3r^2+5r-2=0$, $r=\\frac13$. $2a^2(1+r^2)=20$ → $a^2=9$. $a_1a_6=a^2r^5=\\frac1{27}$",
